Original patch by HaHaWTH <102713261+HaHaWTH@users.noreply.github.com>

Keep CraftBukkit item-use capture and restoration, PortalCreateEvent,
and both End platform tripwire update orders. Only an explicit
BlockDestroyEvent cancellation blocks the follow-up write.

